                            "                  privacy status                Show enabled state, hardware readiness, and settings.\n"
                            "                  privacy enable                Enable nudity detection + look-away.\n"
                            "                  privacy disable               Disable nudity detection (camera behaves normally).\n"
                            "                  privacy set [flags]           Update privacy tuning (rate/threshold/angles/cooldown/announce).",
        "fan":              "Fan speed override and tachometer control. Sub-commands:\n"
                            "                  fan status                    Show duty, backend, RPM, and override state.\n"
                            "                  fan set <pct>                 Pin fan to a fixed duty % (0–100), bypasses thermal loop.\n"
                            "                  fan auto                      Release override — return to thermal auto control.\n"
                            "                  fan curve-status              Show current fan control points (temperature -> duty).\n"
                            "                  fan curve-set <t:d> ...       Set fan control points (example: fan curve-set 25:0 47:80 50:100).\n"
                            "                  fan tach-status               Show tach enabled state and current RPM.\n"
